<fw type="header" place="top">Die Erb&#x017F;chleicher.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#GER"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Gerhard.</hi></speaker> <p>Ma&#x0364;dchen &#x2014; du bi&#x017F;t ausgela&#x017F;&#x017F;en<supplied>.</supplied></p></sp><lb/>
