<fw type="header" place="top">Die Erb&#x017F;chleicher.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#PIS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Pi&#x017F;torius</hi></speaker> <stage>(indem er Hut, Stock, und Degen und<lb/>
