<sp who="#JUS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ju&#x017F;tine.</hi></speaker> <p>Wenn <hi rendition="#g">Sie</hi> nichts haben!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#PIS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Pi&#x017F;torius.</hi></speaker> <p>Dreyßig Febrezetanten hab ich.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#JUS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ju&#x017F;tine.</hi></speaker> <p>Dreyßig Kandidaten des Kirchhofs!</p></sp><lb/>
