<pb n="143" facs="#f0149"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Die Erb&#x017F;chleicher.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#WEIN"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Weinhold.</hi></speaker> <p>Fu&#x0364;r &#x017F;o leichtgla&#x0364;ubig ha&#x0364;tt&#x2019; ich<lb/>
