<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">W. Ungew.</hi></fw></sp><lb/>
<pb n="145" facs="#f0151"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Die Erb&#x017F;chleicher.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#WUNGE"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">W. Ungew.</hi></speaker> <p>Das wa&#x0364;re klein! <hi rendition="#g">Ich</hi> ku&#x0364;&#x017F;&#x017F;e<lb/>
