<fw type="sig" place="bottom">M 3</fw><lb/>
<pb n="182" facs="#f0188"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Die Erb&#x017F;chleicher.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#WEIN"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Weinhold.</hi></speaker> <p>Ihre Prophezeihung, Muhme!</p><lb/>
<stage>(Blä&#x017F;t)</stage> <p>Buh! gehts aus!</p></sp><lb/>
